{
  "short_id": "short298",
  "episode_id": "PD-2026-075-lahaina",
  "voice_stage": "master",
  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.26,
  "total_seconds": 51.51,
  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-075-lahaina\\06_voice\\master\\short298_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Hawaiʻi has more outdoor warning sirens than any other place on earth. More than four hundred of them stand on the islands.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.362,
      "seconds": 6.362,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:ebe8028ef50b594c6d1fbfd01b74e872b0c3b3485443631b814e01b357a257ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "They are tested. On a schedule, in public, on the first business day of every month.",
      "start": 6.582,
      "end": 11.087,
      "seconds": 4.505,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:c8fea8dbce574c6342224995887bfbe25cb688f389ba87836f7e398647415840"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "And the state publishes what it is for. Tsunamis. Hurricanes. Flooding. Wildfires. Wildfires are on the list.",
      "start": 11.307,
      "end": 19.062,
      "seconds": 7.755,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:e633bbbd4d7940dead33f21b68f30c96909cfdd0ebe55ac0f8214f3c54afb95d"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Finding thirty-seven. Only one siren was operable within the burn perimeter of the Lahaina area on August the eighth, twenty twenty-three.",
      "start": 19.282,
      "end": 27.548,
      "seconds": 8.266,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:5235c489ce8cb58d5654c85f1d0a66e4654227c0930d4ee3ace449eb48fbf712"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "One. Inside the area that burned.",
      "start": 27.768,
      "end": 29.858,
      "seconds": 2.09,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b4a2b763e2b91a4f23b22671957662d7509f7b9c0c145a8a38a039eb54dfa825"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Finding thirty-eight is a separate finding, about a separate thing. In the whole life of the largest outdoor warning network in the world, it had never once been used to warn of a fire.",
      "start": 30.078,
      "end": 40.155,
      "seconds": 10.077,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:3218f6a8ef0bffe8c00ebb4df7ed3a6d8f3542e17566ed17f1b1df5723312f7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Not that day. Ever. And it was not used on the eighth of August either.",
      "start": 40.375,
      "end": 44.555,
      "seconds": 4.18,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6bc5d03bfd3fa796d700022f592f205dce89c97788348cc9ca8c362639021a22"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "Eighty-four findings. And not one of them says that sounding the siren would have changed the outcome. That is the finding.",
      "start": 44.775,
      "end": 51.509,
      "seconds": 6.734,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:8dbf03c1d5e28d94316333624c9e3c50b410ce4073dd587d4ca00ff8d936058b"
    }
  ]
}
